bunnyhop|Bunny hop|persist|sv_enablebunnyhopping 1;sv_autobunnyhopping 1|sv_enablebunnyhopping 0;sv_autobunnyhopping 0
infinite_ammo|Infinite ammo|persist|sv_infinite_ammo 1|sv_infinite_ammo 0
